<title>SENEGAL: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP EURO-AFRICAN ZONE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP EURO-AFRICAN ZONE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DAKAR 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results Davis Cup Euro-Africa Zone</p>
<p>group three matches on saturday:</p>
<p>Group ABaris Ergun (Turkey) beat Jean Noel Said (Senegal)</p>
<p>4-6 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Christian Rosti (San Marino) beat Anri Makichian (Armenia) 6-1</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Group BJohnny Goudenbour (Luxembourg) beat Lazar Magdincev</p>
<p>(Macedonia) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Eldar Mustafic (Bosnia) beat Samuel Gebriel (Ethiopia) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Add group B</p>
<p>Zoran Sevcenko (Macedonia) beat Sacha Thoma (Luxemburg) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Merid Zahirovic (Bosnia) beat Yohannes Setegne (Ethiopia) 2-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Add group A</p>
<p>Yahiya Doumbia (Senegal) beat Erhan Oral (Turkey) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Domenico Vicini (San Marino) beat Artak Harutyunyan (Armenia)</p>
<p>5-7 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Doubles</p>
<p>Gabriel Francini/Domenico Vicini (San Marino) beat Haik</p>
<p>Hakopian/Anri Makichian (Armenia) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Group BEldar Mustafic/Haris Basacic (Bosnia) beat Habtamu</p>
<p>Kidane/Yohannes Setegne (Ethiopia) 6-0 6-0</p>
</text>
